Package: crate
Title: Canonical Schema and Data Governance for New Graph Environment
Version: 0.4.0
Date: 2026-09-02Authors@R:
    person("Allan", "Irvine", , "al@newgraphenvironment.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3495-2128"))
Description: Source-explicit dispatcher and declarative schemas for
    canonicalizing heterogeneous data inputs across the New Graph Environment
    ecosystem. Ships canonical-shape schemas, decision logs, and adapter
    functions that insulate downstream consumers (link, fresh, reporting
    repos) from upstream-shape variability. First instance: bcfishpass
    override CSVs.
